# The MineNest release XenithOS installs (github.com/OwenCosta/minenest), and the SHA-256 of each of
# its Linux programs. get-minenest.sh downloads that release and keeps a file only if it matches the
# hash here. The release's own SHA256SUMS isn't trusted, so a changed release can't reach a PC.
# This file comes inside XenithOS's source, whose own SHA-256 is in XenithOS Cloud's signed Store
# list. A new MineNest for XenithOS is a commit that changes the version and both hashes, checked
# against the files themselves (not only against the release's list).
version=0.3.0
5188280a8a62f23a08760efdcfefca1c9eac725c6dc1660f760a8d54765f141b  minenest-linux-amd64
17ef64912569c1094653391262a800031f9059eafef2152e065b809162f081a1  minenest-linux-arm64
